{"title": "Perform 'Old Time Battles'", "pageid": 12107, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Perform_'Old_Time_Battles'", "categories": ["Class actions", "Performable music"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Perform_%27Old_Time_Battles%27.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Perform_%27Old_Time_Battles%27.webp/300px-Perform_%27Old_Time_Battles%27.webp, /w/images/b/bf/Perform_%27Old_Time_Battles%27.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Perform_%27Old_Time_Battles%27.webp/300px-Perform_%27Old_Time_Battles%27.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Perform_%27Old_Time_Battles%27.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Perform 'Old Time Battles'</b> is a free action that allows the user to play the song 'Old Time Battles' using their equipped <a href=\"/wiki/Instrument\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Instrument\">Instrument</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nPlay a rousing battle-chant to attract and delight those around you.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UIDs</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_Bard_Perform_Stargazing_Drum</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Bard_Perform_Stargazing_Drum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Bard_Perform_Stargazing_Drum\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div><code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_Bard_Perform_Stargazing_Flute</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Bard_Perform_Stargazing_Flute\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Bard_Perform_Stargazing_Flute\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div><code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_Bard_Perform_Stargazing_Lute</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Bard_Perform_Stargazing_Lute\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Bard_Perform_Stargazing_Lute\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div><code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_Bard_Perform_Stargazing_Lyre</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Bard_Perform_Stargazing_Lyre\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Bard_Perform_Stargazing_Lyre\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div><code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_Bard_Perform_Stargazing_Violin</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Bard_Perform_Stargazing_Violin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Bard_Perform_Stargazing_Violin\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div><code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_Bard_Perform_Stargazing_Whistle</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Bard_Perform_Stargazing_Whistle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Bard_Perform_Stargazing_Whistle\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=DontAbortPerforming_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"DontAbortPerforming (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">DontAbortPerforming</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=ImmediateCast_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"ImmediateCast (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">ImmediateCast</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span id=\"Condition:_Performing_.27Old_Time_Battles.27\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Performing_'Old_Time_Battles'\"> Condition: Performing 'Old Time Battles' </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Performing_%27Old_Time_Battles%27_(Condition)\" title=\"Performing 'Old Time Battles' (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Performing_%27Old_Time_Battles%27_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Performing_%27Old_Time_Battles%27_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Performing_%27Old_Time_Battles%27_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Performing_%27Old_Time_Battles%27_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Performing_%27Old_Time_Battles%27_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Performing_%27Old_Time_Battles%27_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Performing 'Old Time Battles'\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Performing_%27Old_Time_Battles%27_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Performing_%27Old_Time_Battles%27_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Performing_%27Old_Time_Battles%27_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Performing_%27Old_Time_Battles%27_(Condition)\" title=\"Performing 'Old Time Battles' (Condition)\">Performing 'Old Time Battles'</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Playing a tune. Perform the same song nearby to join in.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Poor_Performance\"> Condition: Poor Performance </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poor_Performance_(Condition)\" title=\"Poor Performance (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poor Performance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/de/Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Poor_Performance_(Condition)\" title=\"Poor Performance (Condition)\">Poor Performance</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Maybe you'd better stop, before anyone starts throwing rocks.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Having an <a href=\"/wiki/Instrument\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Instrument\">Instrument</a> equipped.</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>If multiple characters use the Perform action, they sync up and play together. Also nearby bards, such as in the <a href=\"/wiki/Circus_of_the_Last_Days\" title=\"Circus of the Last Days\">Circus of the Last Days</a>, can join the performance.\n<ul><li>If multiple characters perform the same song, the individual instruments can be heard together as the song is played (e.g., <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lute\" title=\"Lute\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e4/Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lute\" title=\"Lute\">lute</a> and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Violin\" title=\"Violin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Instrument_Violin_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Violin\" title=\"Violin\">violin</a>).</li>\n<li>Multiple instruments are more easily heard if ambient volume in the game's audio settings is moved to or near zero.\n<ul><li>A harmonious example of multiple instruments can occur after Ketheric Thorm's defeat, when a player character on the violin joins Alfira on her lute to perform for the tiefling children.</li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li>Nearby NPCs gather to hear the performance and focus their attention on the performer(s). This can create an opportunity for pickpocketing and thievery. Many patrolling NPCs cannot be distracted this way.</li>\n<li>If the performer has <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency#Instrument_proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">musical instrument proficiency</a>, they make a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Performance\" title=\"Performance\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Performance_Icon.png/25px-Performance_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Performance_Icon.png/38px-Performance_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Performance_Icon.png/50px-Performance_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Performance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Performance_Icon.png/25px-Performance_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Performance_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Performance\" title=\"Performance\">Performance</a> check. If successful, the gathered audience tips the performer with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Toss_a_Coin\" title=\"Toss a Coin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp/20px-Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp/30px-Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp/40px-Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Toss a Coin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp/20px-Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a9/Toss_a_Coin_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Toss_a_Coin\" title=\"Toss a Coin\">Toss a Coin</a> when the performance ends. However, a successful performance does not necessarily result in every attendee tipping the performer(s).</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Difficulty_Class\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Difficulty Class\">Difficulty Class</a> of the performance check scales with the size of the audience:\n<ul><li>1 audience member: DC 10</li>\n<li>2-3 audience members: DC 12</li>\n<li>4-5 audience members: DC 15</li>\n<li>6-7 audience members: DC 18</li>\n<li>8+ audience members: DC 20</li></ul></li>\n<li>Any character can use the Perform action with an instrument equipped. However, a character without instrument proficiency makes a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poor_Performance_(Condition)\" title=\"Poor Performance (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poor Performance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/de/Poor_Performance_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Poor_Performance_(Condition)\" title=\"Poor Performance (Condition)\">Poor Performance</a> when doing so. This provokes annoyed reactions from the audience who will leave immediately.</li>\n<li>Perform is a free action, and can be used during battle. The performance ends if the performing character is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Threatened_(Condition)\" title=\"Threatened (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Threatened\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Threatened_(Condition)\" title=\"Threatened (Condition)\">Threatened</a>.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>The orchestral versions of Old Time Battles (Bard version) (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6GSMhFofV_A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Old Time Battles Part I\" src=\"/w/images/7/75/YouTube.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6GSMhFofV_A\">Old Time Battles Part I</a></span> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GR0XFRvpCKs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Old Time Battles Part II\" src=\"/w/images/7/75/YouTube.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GR0XFRvpCKs\">Old Time Battles Part II</a></span>) can be heard while fighting <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/W%27wargaz\" title=\"W'wargaz\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_W%27wargaz.png/25px-Portrait_W%27wargaz.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_W%27wargaz.png/38px-Portrait_W%27wargaz.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_W%27wargaz.png/50px-Portrait_W%27wargaz.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"W'wargaz\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_W%27wargaz.png/25px-Portrait_W%27wargaz.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c3/Portrait_W%27wargaz.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/W%27wargaz\" title=\"W'wargaz\">W'wargaz</a>.<sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">[<a href=\"/wiki/bg3wiki:Verification\" title=\"bg3wiki:Verification\"><span aria-label=\"People also point to thes...\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"bg3wiki-help-tooltip\"><i>verify</i></span></a>]</sup></li></ul>\n</div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"OST\">OST</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"embedvideo\" data-service=\"youtube\" data-mw-iframeconfig=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/Zj8cCfnP_hQ?autoplay=1&quot;}\" style=\"width:640px\">\n\t<div class=\"embedvideo-wrapper\" style=\"height:360px\">\n\t\t<div class=\"embedvideo-consent\" data-show-privacy-notice=\"1\">\n\t<div class=\"embedvideo-overlay\">\n\t\t<div class=\"embedvideo-loader\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"embedvideo-loader__fakeButton\">Load video</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"embedvideo-loader__footer\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"embedvideo-loader__service\">YouTube</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"embedvideo-privacyNotice hidden\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"embedvideo-privacyNotice__content\">YouTube might collect personal data. <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/howyoutubeworks/user-settings/privacy/\" rel=\"nofollow,noopener\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"embedvideo-privacyNotice__link\">Privacy Policy</a></div>\n\t\t\t